  "decision_conditions": [
    "Dimenisons needed for sycamores. The specification needs to be measurable and quantifiable so that we can understand the amount that is to be removed in meters. We need to know the amount to be removed and the remaining crown size. E.g. 2m crown reduction in width and 2m reduction in height, leaving a canopy spread of 3m and height of 5m. You can only remove overhanging branches up to your boundary line and no further."
